{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a massive-scale MMO-themed Fantasy World where you design all Creatures, Objects, Quests , Events and Dungeons and watch the Inhabitants of your World embark on Adventures!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a massive Fantasy World on a 2500x2000 Canvas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/96b8a6d926ecd277f59e435910b24e54.poster.avif?t=1761940745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/96b8a6d926ecd277f59e435910b24e54.webm?t=1761940745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/96b8a6d926ecd277f59e435910b24e54.mp4?t=1761940745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on a 5.000.000 Tiles big Canvas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between an empty and randomly generated World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 biomes ( final game will have 14)</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Points of Interest to make the World feel alive!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/b45d97299565c039850fd52a8b866f52.poster.avif?t=1761940745\" width=800 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/b45d97299565c039850fd52a8b866f52.webm?t=1761940745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points of Interest:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create unlimited Points of Interest (Exterior &amp; Interior) with the ingame <strong>World Editor</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design <strong>Cities,Villages,Castles,Caves,Dungeons</strong> and more!</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch as your Inhabitants embark on Adventures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/40b4066f7395069b457bbbdb08624d42.poster.avif?t=1761940745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/40b4066f7395069b457bbbdb08624d42.webm?t=1761940745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/40b4066f7395069b457bbbdb08624d42.mp4?t=1761940745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inhabitants</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your Adventurers pick 1 out of 12 available classes before they embark on the Adventures <strong>that you designed!</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes:</strong> Barbarian, Paladin, Fighter, Cleric, Wizard, Druid, Bloodmage, Assassin, Rogue, Gunslinger, Ranger, Bard</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Define Regions and Zones!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/0ff413157e0c31c53ad720f8f42a192b.poster.avif?t=1761940745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447280/extras/0ff413157e0c31c53ad720f8f42a192b.webm?t=1761940745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\